{
  "declaredLength": 11984,
  "decoding": "confirmed-per-slot-XOR-rotate3-index-seed",
  "format": "GF Trinity encrypted UTF-16 message DAT",
  "initialKey": 0,
  "messages": [
    {
      "displayText": "I can make all manner of donuts,\nso long as you have the right Berries!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 0,
      "offsetInSection": 572,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0049002000630061006E0020006D0061006B006500200061006C006C0020006D0061006E006E006500720020006F006600200064006F006E007500740073002C000A0073006F0020006C006F006E006700200061007300200079006F00750020006800610076006500200074006800650020007200690067006800740020004200650072007200690065007300210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 72
    },
    {
      "displayText": "The secret to my donuts’ special flavor is getting\nthe perfect combination of Berries, you know!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 1,
      "offsetInSection": 716,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 97
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Did you know that the hole in the middle\nof a donut helps it cook more evenly?",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 2,
      "offsetInSection": 912,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 79
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Do you think the world might look different\nwhen viewed through the hole of a donut?",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 3,
      "offsetInSection": 1072,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 85
    },
    {
      "displayText": "I am particularly fond of kneading the dough\nfor my donuts. It’s so absorbing.",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 4,
      "offsetInSection": 1244,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 79
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Adding yeast to your dough can make quite\nan impact on the texture of your donuts.",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 5,
      "offsetInSection": 1404,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 83
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Welcome to Ansha’s Donuts, your own\nlittle neighborhood shop within Hotel Z!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 6,
      "offsetInSection": 1572,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 77
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Welcome to Ansha’s Donuts! There simply would\nbe no exploring Hyperspace Lumiose without us!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 7,
      "offsetInSection": 1728,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 93
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Welcome to Ansha’s Donuts—\npurveyor of Hoopa’s absolute favorites!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 8,
      "offsetInSection": 1916,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00570065006C0063006F006D006500200074006F00200041006E0073006800612019007300200044006F006E0075007400732014000A007000750072007600650079006F00720020006F006600200048006F006F00700061201900730020006100620073006F006C0075007400650020006600610076006F0072006900740065007300210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 67
    },
    {
      "displayText": "I’m feeling in particularly fine form today. Just\nwatch—I’ll make any donut you could ask for!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 9,
      "offsetInSection": 2052,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 95
    },
    {
      "displayText": "“Come on in! Grab a seat wherever you like!”<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nOh, wouldn’t it be droll if I ran a real restaurant!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 10,
      "offsetInSection": 2244,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 101
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Did you know that the malasadas enjoyed\nin the Alola region are also a type of donut?",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 11,
      "offsetInSection": 2448,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 86
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Let’s spread the love of donuts! It will be like\na great ring of joy encircling the entire world!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 12,
      "offsetInSection": 2620,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 98
    },
    {
      "displayText": "I’ve made so many donuts here with you...and I\nstill haven’t grown even a little tired of doing so!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 13,
      "offsetInSection": 2816,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 100
    },
    {
      "displayText": "I will try to make the greatest of donuts—a donut\neven capable of withstanding great Mega Power!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 14,
      "offsetInSection": 3016,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 97
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Now I can use up to four Berries\nwhen making a donut for you!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 15,
      "offsetInSection": 3212,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004E006F007700200049002000630061006E002000750073006500200075007000200074006F00200066006F0075007200200042006500720072006900650073000A007700680065006E0020006D0061006B0069006E00670020006100200064006F006E0075007400200066006F007200200079006F007500210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 62
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Now I can use up to five Berries\nwhen making a donut for you!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 16,
      "offsetInSection": 3336,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004E006F007700200049002000630061006E002000750073006500200075007000200074006F0020006600690076006500200042006500720072006900650073000A007700680065006E0020006D0061006B0069006E00670020006100200064006F006E0075007400200066006F007200200079006F007500210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 62
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Now I can use up to six Berries\nwhen making a donut for you!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 17,
      "offsetInSection": 3460,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004E006F007700200049002000630061006E002000750073006500200075007000200074006F002000730069007800200042006500720072006900650073000A007700680065006E0020006D0061006B0069006E00670020006100200064006F006E0075007400200066006F007200200079006F007500210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 61
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Now I can use up to seven Berries\nwhen making a donut for you!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 18,
      "offsetInSection": 3584,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004E006F007700200049002000630061006E002000750073006500200075007000200074006F00200073006500760065006E00200042006500720072006900650073000A007700680065006E0020006D0061006B0069006E00670020006100200064006F006E0075007400200066006F007200200079006F007500210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 63
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Now I can use up to eight Berries\nwhen making a donut for you!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 19,
      "offsetInSection": 3712,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004E006F007700200049002000630061006E002000750073006500200075007000200074006F00200065006900670068007400200042006500720072006900650073000A007700680065006E0020006D0061006B0069006E00670020006100200064006F006E0075007400200066006F007200200079006F007500210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 63
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Would you like something spicy? Perhaps sweet\nor tart? Or maybe a fresh flavor—or a bitter one!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 20,
      "offsetInSection": 3840,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 96
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Keep ordering more donuts and carrying on\nwith your fine survey work, if you please!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 21,
      "offsetInSection": 4032,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 85
    },
    {
      "displayText": "I’ll start heating the butter at once—\nwe’ll have it melted and ready to go!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 22,
      "offsetInSection": 4204,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 77
    },
    {
      "displayText": "If you order lots of donuts now, you won’t\nneed to return as often to Hotel Z for more.",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 23,
      "offsetInSection": 4360,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 88
    },
    {
      "displayText": "The secret to mashing Berries is doing it\nfinely enough to keep the paste smooth.",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 24,
      "offsetInSection": 4536,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 82
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Donuts here in Lumiose\nare made plenty sweet!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 25,
      "offsetInSection": 4700,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0044006F006E0075007400730020006800650072006500200069006E0020004C0075006D0069006F00730065000A0061007200650020006D00610064006500200070006C0065006E0074007900200073007700650065007400210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 46
    },
    {
      "displayText": "We’re here to support your investigations\nwith my donuts and Hoopa’s powers!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 26,
      "offsetInSection": 4792,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 77
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Please try finding the perfect combination\nof Berries to get just the effects you wish.",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 27,
      "offsetInSection": 4948,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 88
    },
    {
      "displayText": "A donut’s hole is a curious\nthing—a thing of nothing.",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 28,
      "offsetInSection": 5124,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004100200064006F006E007500742019007300200068006F006C00650020006900730020006100200063007500720069006F00750073000A007400680069006E0067201400610020007400680069006E00670020006F00660020006E006F007400680069006E0067002E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 54
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Truly, Hyperspace Berries are the most\nmysterious and wondrous of Berries.",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 29,
      "offsetInSection": 5232,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 75
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Do not forget the value of a good Level\nBoost when placing your donut order!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 30,
      "offsetInSection": 5384,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 77
    },
    {
      "displayText": "If you don’t provide Hoopa with enough Donut\nEnergy, your survey work may get cut short.",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 31,
      "offsetInSection": 5540,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 89
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Oh—I would like to try my hand at making a donut\nthat could lead you to meet more alpha Pokémon!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 32,
      "offsetInSection": 5720,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 97
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Perhaps a donut could help you meet more\nShiny Pokémon... That would be delightful!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 33,
      "offsetInSection": 5916,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 84
    },
    {
      "displayText": "The higher the Flavor Score a donut\nhas, the stronger its effects will be!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 34,
      "offsetInSection": 6084,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 75
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Hoopa does adore sweet donuts!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 35,
      "offsetInSection": 6236,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0048006F006F0070006100200064006F00650073002000610064006F0072006500200073007700650065007400200064006F006E00750074007300210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 31
    },
    {
      "displayText": "I think Shiny Pokémon would like something nice\nand tempting—perhaps a sweet-flavored donut?",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 36,
      "offsetInSection": 6300,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 93
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Very sweet donuts should bring you\ngood luck in various forms, I believe.",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 37,
      "offsetInSection": 6488,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "005600650072007900200073007700650065007400200064006F006E007500740073002000730068006F0075006C00640020006200720069006E006700200079006F0075000A0067006F006F00640020006C00750063006B00200069006E00200076006100720069006F0075007300200066006F0072006D0073002C00200049002000620065006C0069006500760065002E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 74
    },
    {
      "displayText": "A spicy donut with curry would be a very\nHotel Z kind of donut, don’t you agree?",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 38,
      "offsetInSection": 6636,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 81
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Perhaps the spices in a curry donut could\nstimulate your Pokémon’s offensive abilities.",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 39,
      "offsetInSection": 6800,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 88
    },
    {
      "displayText": "I do feel that a spicy donut would offer some\nadvantages for going on the offense in battle.",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 40,
      "offsetInSection": 6976,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 93
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Hoopa does enjoy a nice tart flavor,\nif you make a donut that’s a bit sour.",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 41,
      "offsetInSection": 7164,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 76
    },
    {
      "displayText": "A donut that makes it easier to obtain Berries\nmeans you can bring me even more ingredients!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 42,
      "offsetInSection": 7316,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 93
    },
    {
      "displayText": "It seems sour donuts can grant all sorts\nof effects for the items you might find.",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 43,
      "offsetInSection": 7504,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 82
    },
    {
      "displayText": "You might not expect it, but Hoopa does\nenjoy a mature, bitter flavor profile as well.",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 44,
      "offsetInSection": 7668,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 87
    },
    {
      "displayText": "I hope this donut can help keep you safe\nfrom incoming attacks of a particular type.",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 45,
      "offsetInSection": 7844,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 85
    },
    {
      "displayText": "I believe bitter donuts will be effective\nat boosting your team’s defenses.",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 46,
      "offsetInSection": 8016,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 76
    },
    {
      "displayText": "A lovely fresh flavor can be just the thing to\ndeliver a little shock to Hoopa’s taste buds!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 47,
      "offsetInSection": 8168,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 93
    },
    {
      "displayText": "I recommend a fresh flavor if you’re making a\ndonut with the aim of catching more Pokémon.",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 48,
      "offsetInSection": 8356,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 91
    },
    {
      "displayText": "I believe fresh flavors ought to produce donuts\nthat help you successfully catch wild Pokémon.",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 49,
      "offsetInSection": 8540,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 95
    },
    {
      "displayText": "I do wonder what effects this combination could\nproduce. We’ll find out once it’s done, won’t we!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 50,
      "offsetInSection": 8732,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 98
    },
    {
      "displayText": "This will be an astoundingly special donut\nthat’s worthy of Operation Mega Donut!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 51,
      "offsetInSection": 8928,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 82
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Oh, I hope you’ll get to meet a fine Groudon!\nLet’s put in plenty of Berries to be sure!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 52,
      "offsetInSection": 9092,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 89
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Oh, I hope you’ll get to meet a fine Kyogre!\nLet’s put in plenty of Berries to be sure!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 53,
      "offsetInSection": 9272,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 88
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Oh, I hope you’ll get to meet that fine Rayquaza!\nThis donut should be bursting with Berries!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 54,
      "offsetInSection": 9448,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 94
    },
    {
      "displayText": "I feel very good about this—together we’ll\ncreate the ultimate Plasma-Glazed Donut!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 55,
      "offsetInSection": 9636,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 84
    },
    {
      "displayText": "What has you so deep in thought? Are you\ndreaming up a particularly strange donut?",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 56,
      "offsetInSection": 9804,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 83
    },
    {
      "displayText": "I can make a donut from any combination\nof Berries at all—just you wait and see!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 57,
      "offsetInSection": 9972,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 81
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Oh dear. Are you feeling overwhelmed\nby all of your available donut options?",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 58,
      "offsetInSection": 10136,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 77
    },
    {
      "displayText": "If you find yourself troubled over what to choose,\njust toss in anything! We can always make more!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 59,
      "offsetInSection": 10292,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 99
    },
    {
      "displayText": "You seem to have ground to a halt!\nToo many options to choose from?",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 60,
      "offsetInSection": 10492,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0059006F00750020007300650065006D00200074006F00200068006100760065002000670072006F0075006E006400200074006F00200061002000680061006C00740021000A0054006F006F0020006D0061006E00790020006F007000740069006F006E007300200074006F002000630068006F006F00730065002000660072006F006D003F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 68
    },
    {
      "displayText": "It’s amusing to see that even you sometimes find\nyourself in a daze, <U+0010><U+0002>Ā<U+0000>.",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 61,
      "offsetInSection": 10628,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 75
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Making donuts is, in effect, making\nhappiness. Wouldn’t you agree?",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 62,
      "offsetInSection": 10780,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004D0061006B0069006E006700200064006F006E007500740073002000690073002C00200069006E0020006500660066006500630074002C0020006D0061006B0069006E0067000A00680061007000700069006E006500730073002E00200057006F0075006C0064006E2019007400200079006F0075002000610067007200650065003F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 67
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Observing the fundamentals and pouring your\nheart into your work makes for a fine donut.",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 63,
      "offsetInSection": 10916,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 89
    },
    {
      "displayText": "I’ll do all I can to make donuts\nthat Pokémon find delicious!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 64,
      "offsetInSection": 11096,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00492019006C006C00200064006F00200061006C006C00200049002000630061006E00200074006F0020006D0061006B006500200064006F006E007500740073000A007400680061007400200050006F006B00E9006D006F006E002000660069006E0064002000640065006C006900630069006F0075007300210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 62
    },
    {
      "displayText": "It is said that a person’s tastes\ncan tell you quite a lot about them.",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 65,
      "offsetInSection": 11220,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0049007400200069007300200073006100690064002000740068006100740020006100200070006500720073006F006E201900730020007400610073007400650073000A00630061006E002000740065006C006C00200079006F0075002000710075006900740065002000610020006C006F0074002000610062006F007500740020007400680065006D002E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 71
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Eating truly is one of the fundamental\nexperiences of being alive, isn’t it?",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 66,
      "offsetInSection": 11364,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 77
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Good cooking comes from a solid foundation.\nRushing it won’t do any good for anyone.",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 67,
      "offsetInSection": 11520,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 85
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Do take your time deciding.",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 68,
      "offsetInSection": 11692,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0044006F002000740061006B006500200079006F00750072002000740069006D00650020006400650063006900640069006E0067002E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 28
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Din, din, don...\nDin, din, don... ♪",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 69,
      "offsetInSection": 11748,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00440069006E002C002000640069006E002C00200064006F006E002E002E002E000A00440069006E002C002000640069006E002C00200064006F006E002E002E002E0020266A0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 36
    },
    {
      "displayText": "I suppose the chef I most admire would\nhave to be...Mr. Siebold. He is wonderful.",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 70,
      "offsetInSection": 11820,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 82
    }
